{
  "about": "Every typed example in the website's illustration models, replayed through the engine by DauEngine's WebsiteExamplesTests so the site cannot show text the engine does not produce.",
  "fields": {
    "id": "Stable kebab-case key, named after where the example is shown; the site looks examples up by it.",
    "method": "\"telex\" or \"vni\".",
    "keys": "Exact key sequence typed into an empty field; spaces are typed keys. Optional keys typed after typedWord when it is present.",
    "expected": "Text in the field after the keys, with default settings (D15) unless settings says otherwise.",
    "settings": "Optional. Non-default engine options. Supported: {\"tonePlacement\": \"classic\"} (old tone placement, hòa and thúy).",
    "frames": "Optional, for examples the site animates key by key. frames[i] is the full field text after key i (one key per character, a space is a key); for typedWord examples the frames start after the seed. The last frame equals expected.",
    "typedWord": "Optional. D20 scenario: a word already in the document, right before the cursor, that the engine is seeded with before keys are typed. expected is then the word after the keys."
  },
  "examples": [
